 in our Early Access:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840890/extras/ffbe1035e806a10e63b2621f6fc6bf2d.avif?t=1772367028\" width=1560 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840890/extras/db8669d366cb6a3c0ca52b9abb215e0c.avif?t=1772367028\" width=1560 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840890/extras/ecf791fa491ccf204bfb0832d3638866.avif?t=1772367028\" width=1560 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We repeat again: the Universe of Nekokami is thoroughly, totally inhibited by Cats. Your colleagues are Cats. You seem to be a Cat. Even the gods and spirits (the Kami*) roaming among the stars are Cats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Your Cat colleagues can be found working on all sorts of environments and biomes over the Milky Way. <u>Every one of the 30 Star Systems is a world of its own!</u> Don't worry, your Cat colleagues probably don't completely get what they are doing as well. You can always experiment at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840890/extras/5f9a94ee3be8f395a138a002400291f9.poster.avif?t=1772367028\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840890/extras/5f9a94ee3be8f395a138a002400291f9.webm?t=1772367028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840890/extras/5f9a94ee3be8f395a138a002400291f9.mp4?t=1772367028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc08 Oh yes, the Kami. Technically the spirits are the real fellows creating the worlds. As a Planetary Architect, you are basically borrowing their Creative Energy. You will need to seek their acceptance and approval. Through their friendship, you will potentially learn the secrets of nature and the arcane laws of universe. Maybe someday you will be able to wield godly powers?  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840890/extras/5212ea7f4ae3b41bda5108db7503614a.poster.avif?t=1772367028\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840890/extras/5212ea7f4ae3b41bda5108db7503614a.webm?t=1772367028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840890/extras/5212ea7f4ae3b41bda5108db7503614a.mp4?t=1772367028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Kami: A Japanese word that would roughly, but not completely, translates to &quot;spirits and gods&quot; in English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840890/extras/db8669d366cb6a3c0ca52b9abb215e0c.avif?t=1772367028\" width=1560 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80<strong> Developer's Note </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is being created by a tiny tiny indie game studio in Fukuoka, Japan. We hope you'll enj